# Prettier only formats the web app, root JS/JSON tooling config and client GraphQL
# operations. Everything else has its own formatter (or none, on purpose).
*

!*/
!web/**
!shared/src/**/*.graphql
# backend/graphql/schema.graphql is left out: its aligned field comments are
# its documentation, and Prettier collapses them. graphql-eslint still checks it.
!*.{js,json,yml}
!.prettierrc.json

**/node_modules/**
**/dist/**
web/src/generated/**
package-lock.json
web/package-lock.json
.claude/**
